  $Monogenic Isotropic Proton Source
  <source> =  1.0          
   s-type =   9            $ Spherical (shell) source
       r1 =   c1           $ Radius of source sphere [cm]
       r2 =   c1           $ Radius of source circle [cm]
      dir =  iso      	   $ Isotropic source
       e0 =  __ENERGY__    $ Particle energy in MeV
 	 proj =  proton        $ Incident particle

